    "notes": "Gratis AI runs open-source language models entirely on the device; there is no account and no server of ours. On first launch the app checks the device and suggests a model; tap Get Started, then Start/Download. The model (about 0.7 GB for LFM 2.5 1.2B on iPhone) downloads once from Hugging Face, so please review on Wi-Fi; after that everything works offline, including in Airplane Mode. Models are third-party open-weight models used under their licences (Apache 2.0, LFM Open License, Gemma Terms); the licence of each model is shown in the picker. Answers are AI-generated and may be inaccurate."
